https://github.com/magenta/magenta-realtime
Copyright 2026 Google LLC. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

This distribution extracts the JAX inference runtime and browser CUDA host from
an early CUDA extension of the upstream v2.0.3 source. It adapts package metadata,
CLI entry points, asset download/verification, worker startup, shared UI exports,
and installation documentation for a standalone CUDA/browser repository.
The reproduced model card omits the original training hardware/software summary;
the complete upstream model card remains available from the linked source.
The model architecture, original model runtime, MusicCoCa, SpectroStream, and
shared PianoKeyboard/PromptSurface components originate in the upstream project.

The sequence-layers dependency is included as a pinned public git submodule:
https://github.com/magenta/sequence-layers
Its license and notices remain in that submodule.

Model weights are downloaded separately from google/magenta-realtime-2.
See MODEL.md and the upstream model card for attribution and usage terms.
